## Step 4 — Complete Your Goal

**Briefly describe what you made or did:**  
I used Codex connected to Roblox Studio to work on my Roblox game called Critter Catcher. In the game, players use different nets to catch animals that spawn throughout the map. Animals can spawn at different rarity levels including common, uncommon, rare, epic, legendary, and mythic, and each animal can have a randomly generated weight.

The game also includes a selling system where different animals have their own price per pound. Players sell the animals they catch for coins and use those coins to purchase better nets and better storage jars. The jars act as the player's inventory system, and upgraded jars allow players to hold more animals or larger animals.

The game currently has one forest biome, where there can be up to 80 critters spawned at one time. I plan to add more biomes later with different animals and rarity distributions. I also completed a working questline during the challenge and plan to add additional quests in the future. Another feature I want to eventually add is a pet system.

